## Rubric
- [x] Confirm aws:PrincipalArn/aws:SourceVpc conditions are mapped to AcceptedButNotEvaluable (bucket_policy.rs:1278-1291).
- [x] Confirm AcceptedButNotEvaluable causes request_effect to skip statements even when Effect=Deny (bucket_policy.rs:549-566).
- [x] Demonstrate with a runtime PoC that a Deny + Allow policy yields ExplicitAllow for a matching principal (policy_bypass test output).
